Ontology(<https://purl.openfaster.org/io/institutional-ontology.owl>
Annotation(dc:title "Institutional Ontology"@en)
Annotation(dc:description "A controlled vocabulary of formal/administrative (institutional, in Searle's sense) concepts, domain-agnostic. Deliberately kept thin -- grows only via a later, separate alignment pass connecting it to module concepts, never by default during module authoring. No content curated yet -- see repo README."@en)
